SUMMARY:The COT Presents: Spring Fling!
DESCRIPTION:Join The Chamber Orchestra of the Triangle for an evening of unique musical collaborations! What happens when you combine Phil Cook’s jazz-influenced folk music with a string quartet? Stir in a composer who cut his teeth in the New Orleans music scene\, add cocktails and desserts\, and you get an experience unlike anything you’ve ever seen before. \nTaking place in a secret location on the American Tobacco Campus\, The COT’s Spring Fling will feature new\, never-before-seen arrangements by Phil Cook and Charles Lumar II\, performed alongside the Durham Fellows String Quartet. Proceeds directly support The COT’s Durham Fellowship and Da Capo education programs\, which bring young professional musicians into third grade classrooms in Durham and Orange County Schools. \nEarly Bird Tickets on sale until May 1\, 2026 for $60 per person. After May 1\, tickets will be available for $75 per person. All tickets include desserts and beverages. Get tickets: www.thecot.org/springfling.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/the-cot-presents-spring-fling/
LOCATION:American Tobacco Campus\, 705 Willard St.\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Annual,Causes,Concert,Date Night,Fundraiser,Live Performance,Music,Wines, Spirits, Beer and Cheer
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Save-the-Date-Preview-Graphic-3.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="The Chamber Orchestra of the Triangle":MAILTO:info@thecot.org
GEO:35.9946036;-78.903407
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=American Tobacco Campus 705 Willard St. Durham NC 27701 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=705 Willard St.:geo:-78.903407,35.9946036
END:VEVENT
