SUMMARY:WUNC’s Youth Reporting Internship Listening Party
DESCRIPTION:Join WUNC’s Youth Reporting Internship for a special listening and viewing party showcasing original\, multi-platform stories created by our Spring 2026 interns—emerging journalists gaining hands-on experience in broadcast and digital storytelling. Held on Thursday\, May 21 from 7–9 PM at Motorco Music Hall in Durham\, this free event offers a first look at the impactful work they’ve produced alongside WUNC’s newsroom. Space is limited\, so register early and join us for an evening of fresh perspectives\, creativity\, and authentic storytelling.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/wuncs-youth-reporting-internship-listening-party/
