SUMMARY:Intro to Tarot
DESCRIPTION:Tarot isn’t about predicting the future. It’s a tool for reflection\, clarity\, and tuning into what you already know. \nJoin Kate at Fate & Folklore for an hour-long intro covering how tarot works\, what the cards mean\, and how to start building a real relationship with your deck. You’ll leave with practical tools\, a solid foundation\, and a clearer sense of whether tarot is the right practice for you.\nQ&A included. \nYou’ll walk away with:\nHow tarot works and what the cards actually mean\nTips for connecting with your own deck\nSimple spreads to start using right away\nQ&A with an experienced practitioner\nThe confidence to know if tarot is right for you
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/intro-to-tarot/
LOCATION:Fate & Folklore\, 123 Market Street\, Durham\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes & Workshops,Spiritual/Religious
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2.jpg
